# Work screenshots (dual-res)

Every product / case image on the site is a **pair**. Do not ship a single webp for both the page and the lightbox.

## Model

| Role | File | Use |
|------|------|-----|
| Preview | `public/work/{case}/{name}-preview.webp` | Cards, case page, carousel |
| Full | `public/work/{case}/{name}-full.webp` | `ImageLightbox` zoom only |

Wire both in `app/data/cases.ts` via `CaseImage`:

- `src` / `width` / `height` → preview
- `srcFull` / `fullWidth` / `fullHeight` → full (required when adding shots)

## Pipeline (mandatory when adding or replacing shots)

1. Prefer **native** captures (browser/OS, long edge 1600+). Chat-compressed ~1024px is OK for preview, weak for lightbox zoom - note that if no better source exists.
2. Keep a source copy under `assets/work/{case}/` (png/jpg).
3. Run:

```bash
node scripts/work-images.mjs --case <slug> --name <kebab-name> <source.png>
```

4. Paste the printed `CaseImage` fields into `cases.ts` (`preview` and/or `images`).
5. Real `alt` text. No stitching / fake full-page composites - use the capture as-is.

## Do not

- Point lightbox and page at the same file
- Upscale small chat attachments and call them "full"
- Invent empty/error UI shots you do not have
- Commit secrets or huge raw dumps outside `assets/work/` + generated `public/work/`

Script details and flags: `scripts/work-images.mjs`. Human plan: `docs/works-plan.md` (Assets).
